    <forecast>
        <area aac="SA_FA001" description="South Australia" type="region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-10-10T04:10:03+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-10T04:10:03+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-09T17:40:03Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-09T17:40:03Z">
                <text type="warning_summary_footer">For latest warnings go to www.bom.gov.au, subscribe to RSS feeds, call 1300 659 210* or listen for warnings on relevant TV and radio broadcasts.</text>
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A high pressure system briefly establishes in the north today. Another series of troughs and cold fronts are expected to enter western SA early on Sunday, crossing the state and then clearing in the east by the end of Monday. A ridge of high pressure will then push into western SA on Monday before the associated high moves into waters south on Tuesday. A trough over the WA/NT border will also extend into SA at times from Monday.</text>
                <text type="product_footer">* Calls to 1300 numbers cost around 27.5c incl. GST, higher from mobiles or public phones.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
        <area aac="SA_PW015" description="Mount Lofty Ranges" type="public-district" parent-aac="SA_FA001">
            <forecast-period index="0" start-time-local="2026-10-10T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-11T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-09T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-10T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Slight chance of a shower, becoming less likely late this afternoon and evening. Winds west to northwesterly 25 to 35 km/h becoming light in the evening. Daytime maximum temperatures between 17 and 20.</text>
                <text type="fire_danger">Moderate</text>
                <text type="uv_alert">Sun protection 9:30am to 4:30pm, UV Index predicted to reach 8 [Very High]</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-10-11T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-12T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-10T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-11T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Sunny morning. High chance of showers in the afternoon and evening. The chance of a thunderstorm in the afternoon and evening. Winds northerly 20 to 30 km/h turning westerly 15 to 20 km/h in the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to around 10 with daytime temperatures reaching 23 to 28.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="2" start-time-local="2026-10-12T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-13T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-11T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-12T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Slight chance of a shower in the morning. The chance of a thunderstorm in the morning. Winds southwesterly 15 to 25 km/h. Overnight temperatures falling to around 12 with daytime temperatures reaching around 17.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-10-13T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-14T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-12T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-13T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Cloudy. Slight chance of a shower, most likely in the morning and afternoon. Winds southwesterly 15 to 25 km/h turning south to southeasterly 15 to 20 km/h during the afternoon. Overnight temperatures falling to between 6 and 10 with daytime temperatures reaching between 14 and 17.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
